ntal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Giant Shrimp\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Giant_Shrimp_73fb8f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Skull%20Helmet\"><img alt=\"Skull Helmet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Skull_Helmet_97328f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Relic Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Relic_Sword_7fa049.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crown%20Armor\"><img alt=\"Crown Armor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crown_Armor_3c8c3d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Glacier Robe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glacier_Robe_f67514.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Frozen Trench 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"93\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Frozen_Trench_1_acccfb.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Frozen Trench 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"94\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Frozen_Trench_2_42579a.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Frozen Trench 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"87\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Frozen_Trench_3_3244af.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.00<br/>June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Frozen Trench</b> is an underwater trench located underground, a bit south of the island <a href=\"#/wiki/Tyrsung\">Tyrsung</a>. The trench as a whole is the main reason why <a href=\"#/wiki/Okolnir\">Okolnir</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Tyrsung\">Tyrsung</a> have shattered altogether. There have been reports of roaming beasts therein and only a worthy explorer would be allowed to go into such a hazardous place.\n</p><p>The trench itself is the home of all types of <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara\">Quaras</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Massive%20Water%20Elemental\">Massive Water Elementals</a>. The area consists of 2 different main floors, and several pits filled with <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara\">Quaras</a> on the third floor of depth.\n</p><p>Before going to the Frozen Trench, you need to complete the \"Undersea Kingdom\" part of <a href=\"#/quest/the-explorer-society-quest\">The Explorer Society Quest</a>.  You then do the \"Frozen Trench\" part of <a href=\"#/quest/the-explorer-society-quest\">The Explorer Society Quest</a>.  A prerequisite of the \"Frozen Trench\" is \"Formorgar Mines 3\" of <a href=\"#/quest/the-ice-islands-quest\">The Ice Islands Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>First floor</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Constrictor\"><img alt=\"Quara Constrictor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Quara_Constrictor_0de67a.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Constrictor\">Quara Constrictor</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">380</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">450</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">344 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">150 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span